@model IReadOnlyList<ServiceOffering>
@{ ViewData["Title"] = "CV Writing & Career Services"; }
<section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span> CONFIDENT CAREERS BEGIN HERE</span><h1>Your next chapter deserves a <em>beautiful introduction.</em></h1><p class="hero-description">Professional CVs and career documents, crafted around your experience, ambitions and the opportunities you want to pursue.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-dark" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Services">Explore our services <span>↗</span></a><a class="text-link" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index" asp-fragment="how">See how it works <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="hero-foot"><div class="tiny-emblem">✧</div><span>THOUGHTFUL WRITING</span><i></i><span>PERSONAL SERVICE</span><i></i><span>MADE FOR YOUR NEXT MOVE</span></div></div>
<div class="hero-showcase" aria-label="Decorative preview of a refined CV document"><div class="hero-blob"></div><div class="hero-orbit">✳</div><div class="paper-back"></div><div class="paper-sheet"><div class="paper-row"><span>JAMIE MORGAN</span><small>STRATEGY · OPERATIONS</small></div><div class="paper-job">Professional<br /><em>Profile.</em></div><div class="paper-rule"></div><small>EXPERIENCE AT A GLANCE</small><div class="paper-bars"><b></b><b></b><b></b></div><small>KEY ACHIEVEMENTS</small><div class="paper-bars second"><b></b><b></b></div><div class="paper-sign">thoughtfully crafted.</div></div><div class="hero-stamp"><span>YOUR STORY.</span><strong>BEAUTIFULLY<br />TOLD.</strong><span>✦</span></div><div class="hero-side-label">A CAREERCRAFT ORIGINAL ✦</div></div></div></section>
<div class="trust-band"><div class="container trust-items"><span>✦ PERSONALISED FOR YOUR GOALS</span><span>✧ PROFESSIONAL PRESENTATION</span><span>✳ MADE FOR REAL OPPORTUNITIES</span></div></div>
<section id="approach" class="section approach-section"><div class="container approach-grid"><div><p class="section-kicker">01 / A MORE THOUGHTFUL WAY</p><h2>You bring the experience.<br /><em>We help it shine.</em></h2></div><div class="approach-right"><p>Every career is different. Your CV should be too. We take the time to understand your strengths, achievements and the roles you're working towards — then turn that information into a clear, credible and compelling career story.</p><div class="approach-points"><span><b>01</b> Tailored to your target roles</span><span><b>02</b> Clear, confident writing</span><span><b>03</b> Thoughtful, polished formatting</span></div></div></div></section>
<section id="services" class="section services-section"><div class="container"><div class="heading-row"><div><p class="section-kicker">02 / OUR SERVICES</p><h2>Choose your <em>next move.</em></h2></div><p>Whether your CV needs a little refinement or a completely fresh start, there's a service designed for you.</p></div><div class="service-grid">
@foreach (var item in Model) {
  <article class="service-card @item.Accent">
    <div class="service-card-top"><span>@(item.Name == "Career Bundle" ? "COMPLETE PACKAGE" : "CAREER SERVICES")</span><span class="service-icon">@(item.Name == "Cover Letter" ? "✉" : item.Name == "Career Bundle" ? "✦" : item.Name == "CV Refresh" ? "✳" : "↗")</span></div>
    <h3>@item.Name</h3><p>@item.Summary</p><div class="service-card-foot"><div><small>STARTING AT</small><strong>R @item.Price.ToString("0")</strong></div><a asp-controller="Orders" asp-action="Create" asp-route-service="@item.Slug" aria-label="Enquire about @item.Name">↗</a></div>
  </article>
}</div><p class="fineprint">All prices shown in South African Rand (ZAR). Turnaround times and deliverables are confirmed before an order is accepted. Payments are not yet enabled online.</p></div></section>
<section id="how" class="section process-section"><div class="container"><p class="section-kicker">03 / THE PROCESS</p><div class="process-heading"><h2>Simple steps.<br /><em>Stronger first impressions.</em></h2><p>A personal, straightforward process — designed to take the uncertainty out of your next application.</p></div><div class="steps"><article><span>01</span><div class="step-icon">▤</div><h3>Choose a service</h3><p>Find the right option for your CV and career goals.</p></article><article><span>02</span><div class="step-icon">⌕</div><h3>Tell us your story</h3><p>Share your experience and the jobs you're aiming for.</p></article><article><span>03</span><div class="step-icon">✧</div><h3>We shape your documents</h3><p>Once your request is confirmed, we prepare your agreed documents.</p></article><article><span>04</span><div class="step-icon">↗</div><h3>Move forward</h3><p>Review the final documents and approach new opportunities with confidence.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="manifesto"><div class="container manifesto-inner"><span>✳</span><p>It's more than a document.<br /><em>It's the beginning of what comes next.</em></p><a class="button button-gold" asp-controller="Orders" asp-action="Create">Start your enquiry ↗</a></div></section>
<section id="faq" class="section faq-section"><div class="container faq-layout"><div><p class="section-kicker">04 / GOOD TO KNOW</p><h2>Questions,<br /><em>answered.</em></h2><p>Here are a few things worth knowing before you begin.</p></div><div class="faq-items"><details><summary>Do I need an existing CV? <span>+</span></summary><p>No. If you're starting from scratch, you can still enquire. We'll discuss your work history, education, skills and target positions before confirming the service.</p></details><details><summary>Can you tailor my CV to a specific job? <span>+</span></summary><p>Yes. You can include a target job title and a vacancy link in the initial enquiry so we can understand the role you're aiming for.</p></details><details><summary>How long does it take? <span>+</span></summary><p>Indicative turnaround times range from 2 to 7 working days depending on the service. Your final timeline will be confirmed before accepting your order.</p></details><details><summary>Can I upload my current CV here? <span>+</span></summary><p>Secure document upload and online payment are being prepared. For now, please don't send CVs or sensitive personal documents through this preview website.</p></details><details><summary>Will a new CV guarantee a job interview? <span>+</span></summary><p>No service can guarantee an interview or employment outcome. We focus on accurately presenting your strengths and making your application documents clearer and more professional.</p></details></div></div></section>
<section class="bottom-cta"><div class="container bottom-cta-inner"><p class="section-kicker">READY FOR SOMETHING NEW?</p><h2>Let's make your next <em>move count.</em></h2><p>Tell us where you'd like your career to go. We'll help you choose where to begin.</p><a class="button button-dark" asp-controller="Orders" asp-action="Create">Start an enquiry <span>↗</span></a></div></section>
